<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept deliveryTarget="except_print" id="t00284">
	<title>Vehicle to load (V2L)</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>EV menu 
					<indexterm>vehicle to load (V2L)</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>V2L is the system that provides AC power using the high voltage battery for driving to operate several electronic products.</p>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Q015_E.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>Select the icon on the screen.</p>
		<section>
			<title>Battery discharging limit</title>
			<p>You can set the battery discharging limit for high voltage battery for driving.</p>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig>
									<figgroup>
										<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Q016_E.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout">
									<li>
										<p> <uicontrol>Electricity Usage settings (V2L)</uicontrol> </p>
									</li>
									<li>
										<p> <uicontrol>Min.%</uicontrol> </p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>If the vehicle reaches to the limit, it automatically cut supply of electricity.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e01300">
			<title>Transferring V2L</title>
			<p>Check various information about the V2L in the infotainment system when using the V2L.</p>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01301">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01302">
									<figgroup>
										<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25Q045_E.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<ol outputclass="callout" id="e01303">
									<li>
										<p> <uicontrol>Min. %</uicontrol> </p>
									</li>
									<li>
										<p> <uicontrol>Time remaining</uicontrol> </p>
									</li>
									<li>
										<p> <uicontrol>State of charge</uicontrol> </p>
									</li>
									<li>
										<p> <uicontrol>Distance to empty</uicontrol> </p>
									</li>
								</ol>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>If the vehicle reaches to the limit, it automatically cut supply of electricity.</p>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>